# Incident Report: SOC325 - Unauthorized Cloud Region Access Attempt Detected

## Executive Summary
An unauthorized cloud region access alert was triggered on the SIEM platform under Event ID 303[cite: 11]. Analysis revealed an external actor attempting an automated web brute-force login attack from an unapproved geographic region[cite: 12, 14]. Perimeter defenses successfully blocked the inbound requests (HTTP 403)[cite: 14]. No internal compromise or lateral spread was detected; the incident was closed as **True Positive**[cite: 11, 12].

